(*---
description: 'An evaluation error in an angle action''s subscript also stops the check.'
ref: tlc2/tool/liveness/LNAction.java#eval
features: [liveness]
outcome: evaluation-failure
config: |
  SPECIFICATION Spec
  PROPERTY Prop
  CHECK_DEADLOCK FALSE
---*)
---- MODULE subscript_eval_error_in_check ----
EXTENDS Naturals
VARIABLE x
Next == x < 2 /\ x' = x + 1
Spec == x = 0 /\ [][Next]_x /\ WF_x(Next)
Prop == []<><<TRUE>>_(x + "a")
====

